abstract: >-
  Reproducible longitudinal moral judgement analysis pipeline based on
  two-sided Tobit models with role-specific relational predictors (H1-H5),
  dynamic row-level target/other semantics, and bilingual reporting outputs.
keywords:
  - tobit
  - longitudinal
  - moral judgement
  - role-specific modeling
  - reproducible pipeline
